## 5. Ameliorations du README

### Structure Proposee pour le Nouveau README

```markdown
# LightTS

Modern Next.js boilerplate for building SaaS applications.

## Quick Start

### 1. Clone the boilerplate

\`\`\`bash
git clone https://github.com/your-username/light-ts.git my-new-saas
cd my-new-saas
pnpm install
\`\`\`

### 2. Initialize your project

\`\`\`bash
pnpm init-project
\`\`\`

This will:
- Rename the project to your chosen name
- Update all configuration files
- Create Stripe products (optional)
- Set up NeonDB, Upstash, and Vercel
- Generate your .env.local
- Initialize a fresh git repository

### 3. Start developing

\`\`\`bash
pnpm dev
\`\`\`

## What's Included

- Authentication (GitHub, Google, Magic Links)
- Multi-tenant Organizations
- Stripe Subscriptions
- PostgreSQL with Prisma
- Transactional Emails
- Admin Dashboard
- i18n (EN/FR)

## Commands

| Command | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `pnpm init-project` | Initialize a new project from this boilerplate |
| `pnpm setup` | Configure cloud services (NeonDB, Upstash, Stripe) |
| `pnpm dev` | Start development server |
| `pnpm doctor` | Check project health |
```

